            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-61731-stdlib",
              "name": "GoModuleMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2025-61731 high vulnerability for stdlib package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Building a malicious file with cmd/go can cause can cause a write to an attacker-controlled file with partial control of the file content. The \"#cgo pkg-config:\" directive in a Go source file provides command-line arguments to provide to the Go pkg-config command. An attacker can provide a \"--log-file\" argument to this directive, causing pkg-config to write to an attacker-controlled location."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-61731\nSeverity: high\nPackage: stdlib\nVersion: go1.17.13\nFix Version: 1.24.12,1.25.6\nType: go-module\nLocation: /usr/bin/local-path-provisioner\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2025-61731](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-61731)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-61731**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | stdlib  | go1.17.13  | 1.24.12,1.25.6  | go-module  | /usr/bin/local-path-provisioner  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2025-61731](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-61731)  |\n"
              },
